WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
 Marvel fans, I am here
with Zendaya, MJ herself.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:03.540
How are you?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.650
 I'm good, how are you?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.598
 I'm doing pretty great.

00:00:05.598 --> 00:00:06.665
So I have a couple of questions.

00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:07.465
 Yes.

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:08.940
 This is the biggest
Spider-Man film yet

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.230
and there's a lot of stunts.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.030
 Yes.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.230
 How did it feel to be
web-slinging and flying high?

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.800
 Oh man, it was so much fun.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.329
I loved being able
to do that stuff,

00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:18.100
especially because we
feel incredibly safe.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.680
We have an amazing
stunt coordinator

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.830
and you just get to have fun.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.700
I'm not afraid of
heights in that way

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.220
so I feel really good about it.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.720
 Yeah well I can't wait to see.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.270
How has MJ changed since
we've last seen her?

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.740
 I think she's just
opening up more.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:36.030
I think now that she has Peter
in her life, and someone--

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:39.000
and Ned obviously-- people
who feel that-- love her

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.700
for who she is, I think
she's able to slightly

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.050
just open up a little bit more.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.790
And maybe even be a
little bit more positive,

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.923
because usually she's like
the nihilistic friend, right?

00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:48.090
She's the one that's
always looking

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.680
at things glass
half empty, so it's

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.330
nice to see that side of her.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.980
[MUSIC PLAYING]

